# 14. Explain User Authentication Flow.

### Answer

```text
User Registers

↓

Password Hashed (bcrypt)

↓

Saved in Database

↓

User Logs In

↓

Password Compared

↓

JWT Generated

↓

Token Sent to Client

↓

Client Sends Token with Every Request

↓

Protected Route Verified
```

---

# 15. Explain Refresh Token Flow.

### Answer

```text
User Logs In

↓

Access Token

↓

Refresh Token

↓

Access Token Expires

↓

Refresh Token Sent

↓

Server Verifies Refresh Token

↓

New Access Token Generated
```

This improves security by keeping access tokens short-lived while allowing users to stay logged in.

