# 16. What is Pagination?

### Answer

Pagination divides large datasets into smaller pages to improve performance and reduce the amount of data returned in one request.

### Example

```text
GET /users?page=2&limit=10
```

---

# 17. What is Filtering and Sorting?

### Answer

Filtering returns only records matching specific conditions, while sorting arranges the returned records in a particular order.

### Example

```text
GET /products?category=Book

GET /products?sort=price&order=desc
```

---

# 18. Explain File Upload Flow.

### Answer

```text
Client

↓

Multipart/Form-Data Request

↓

Multer Middleware

↓

Server Storage (Disk/Cloud)

↓

Database Stores File Path

↓

Response Returned
```

Multer processes uploaded files before they are stored or used.

